From: engmessias <vmessiaswt@gmailcom>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 16:23:53 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] feat(fleet): add FleetTuiSessionService for the D4 ops
 (b15a2-S2)

- Host-side composition: injected observer identity + active-session resolver;
  activate/status/deactivate/replay over the existing activation/lifecycle/
  observer machinery; exactly one association per observer session scope.
- Opaque issuer-verifiable cursors (service HMAC over scope digest, stream
  epoch, sequence and TTL); tamper, expiry and scope mismatch fail closed.
- Internal hooks session_status_changed/session_ended for the S4 TUI wiring;
  replay serves the active association only (strict semantics).
- Wire codec: exports validate_ref for host consumers.
- RED-first tests: 16 passed (3x), regression suites 162 passed, ruff clean.
